  "notes": {
    "policy": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "App Store & Google Play rules\n\n• The app works without an account (guest).\n• Buying needs no WeHum login: the store sheet opens straight away.\n• An account is optional, offered after buying (“Save your progress”) and only required to post dedications.\n• Paywall shows price, period, trial terms, auto-renew, Terms (EULA), Privacy and Restore.\n• Account deletion is inside the app.",
      "w": 540,
      "x": -640,
      "y": 1100
    },
    "proto": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Prototype: press Play on 01 · Splash.\n\nMember: Intro → Name → Meditation reminder → Reminder → How to start → App Store sheet → Trial started → Save your progress (or Not now) → Today.\n\nFree: How to start → Continue for free → Today (free) → Membership.\n\nTweaks: Room busy / quiet, program started / none, daily message on / off, motion.",
      "w": 540,
      "x": -640,
      "y": 1900
    },
    "scope": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "V1 scope (Raphael’s notes, Oct 5)\n\nIn V1: intro + 3 setup steps, Today with the Meditation of the Day in 10 / 30 / 45 min, group meditation = the Meditation of the Day started together, Silence Room (members), programs, themes, SoS (How can I help?), Build your own, dedications, progress (no streaks, no grace days), membership $59 Founding 1,000 / $79 / $9.99 with 7-day trial.\n\nFree users: Raphael’s online library (“Free for you”), with the premium Meditation of the Day shown on top.\n\nComing soon (row 11): challenges, gratitude feed, breathwork, milestones. Intent step skipped for now. No previews.",
      "w": 540,
      "x": -640,
      "y": 300
    },
    "sitsNote": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Group meditation: for now it is simply the Meditation of the Day starting for everyone at the same moment. No separate morning/evening schedule.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 10696
    },
