      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Empty-room rule\n\nBelow ~10 people at once, every live pill switches from “sitting now” to “sat today”. We never fake or round up numbers. Use the Room tweak (busy / quiet) on Today, Meditation room, Player and World map to see both."
    },
