      "text": "Accessibility pass\n\nEvery screen must work at 200% text with nothing clipped, with VoiceOver / TalkBack labels on all buttons. The breathing ring is decorative (hidden from screen readers). With Reduce Motion on it stays still: see the Motion tweak on the Player."
